{"text":"This means that Liberia will know its second peaceful democratic transition in six years, thus in a country that was riven by political rivalries, tribalism, and civil war for two decades. It is nonetheless with cautious optimism that we approach this event and the future. Anxiety remain because we know that as impressive as Liberia's rebirth has been, our achievements remain fragile and reversible. Anxiety and misgiving aside, I feel utterly confident that in a decade-long career in public service, I may have learned many valuable lessons which I can share with you today. In my bumpy journey, I have come to value the virtues of hope and resilience. As an actor in Liberia's history, as it unfolded over the last 40 years, I have seen these characteristics come full circle.","words":[{"text":"This","start":0.0,"end":0.72},{"text":"means","start":0.72,"end":1.54},{"text":"that","start":1.54,"end":2.88},{"text":"Liberia","start":2.88,"end":3.32},{"text":"will","start":3.32,"end":3.84},{"text":"know","start":3.84,"end":4.12},{"text":"its","start":4.12,"end":4.34},{"text":"second","start":4.34,"end":4.78},{"text":"peaceful","start":4.78,"end":5.44},{"text":"democratic","start":5.44,"end":6.02},{"text":"transition","start":6.02,"end":6.6},{"text":"in","start":6.6,"end":6.94},{"text":"six","start":6.94,"end":7.22},{"text":"years","start":7.22,"end":7.8,"punct":","},{"text":"thus","start":8.86,"end":9.22},{"text":"in","start":9.22,"end":9.46},{"text":"a","start":9.46,"end":9.64},{"text":"country","start":9.64,"end":10.04},{"text":"that","start":10.04,"end":10.94},{"text":"was","start":10.94,"end":11.14},{"text":"riven","start":11.14,"end":11.48},{"text":"by","start":11.48,"end":11.78},{"text":"political","start":11.78,"end":12.2},{"text":"rivalries","start":12.2,"end":12.96,"punct":","},{"text":"tribalism","start":13.18,"end":13.8,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":13.94,"end":14.02},{"text":"civil","start":14.02,"end":14.3},{"text":"war","start":14.3,"end":14.78},{